    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n#   Datasets:⟨3⟩\n* * *\n ![](https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/64c28e452b1ffc2eecc3ce24/BL8tTMjEhSyxlQOuHnzEh.png) ⟨28⟩\nElpriser⟨28⟩\n/\nnordic-power-market-data⟨29⟩\nlike 0\nFollow\n![⟨30⟩] Elpriser.org 1\nTags:  electricity ⟨31⟩ energy ⟨32⟩ power-markets ⟨33⟩ denmark ⟨34⟩ nordic ⟨35⟩ europe ⟨36⟩ + 1\nLicense:\ncc-by-4.0\n Dataset card ⟨29⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨37⟩ Community 1 ⟨38⟩\nThe dataset is currently empty. Upload or create new data files⟨37⟩. Then, you will be able to explore them in the Dataset Viewer.\n#   ⟨39⟩ Nordic & Western European Power Market Data \nThis collection has been split into one dataset per country for easier browsing and download. This repo is now just an index — the actual data files live here:\n  * **Denmark⟨40⟩** — EDS (Energinet) day-ahead prices + production/consumption back to 2000, plus ENTSO-E load/capacity/interconnector data\n  * **Germany⟨41⟩** — DE-LU zone, prices/generation/load/capacity\n  * **Norway⟨42⟩** — all 5 bidding zones (NO1–NO5)\n  * **Sweden⟨43⟩** — all 4 bidding zones (SE1–SE4)\n  * **Finland⟨44⟩** — FI zone\n  * **Netherlands⟨45⟩** — NL zone\n\n\nAll data is **CC BY 4.0** (Energinet / ENTSO-E Transparency Platform — see each dataset's README for exact attribution). JAO's Nordic flow-based congestion data is deliberately not included anywhere in this collection — their terms prohibit redistribution without prior written authorization.\nCollected for the elpriser.org⟨46⟩ price-forecasting project. Collection scripts: elpriser.org repo⟨47⟩, `scripts/data_backup/`.\nCopy to bucket new \n\nDownloads last month\n    60\nTotal file size: 4.14 kB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨48⟩ Privacy⟨49⟩ About⟨50⟩ Careers⟨51⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
